3 Mapping GNU Make Concepts to Sake
***********************************

Users familiar with GNU Make can translate their build concepts directly
into Sake:

GNU Make Concept       Sake Equivalent
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Variable Definition    ‘(define cc "gcc")’
(‘CC = gcc’)
Conditional Default    ‘(sakevar cflags "-O2")’
(‘CFLAGS ?= -O2’)
Default Goal (‘all:    First defined ‘(target "all" ...)’
main’)
Phony Target           Regular target with non-existent file output
(‘.PHONY: clean’)
Pattern Rule (‘%.o:    Scheme loop using ‘for-each’ or ‘map’
%.c’)
Automatic Variables    String formatting via ‘(format #f ...)’
(‘\(@’, ‘\)<’)


