4 Writing Sakefiles
*******************

A ‘sakefile.scm’ is an executable Scheme script interpreted by GNU Guile
during the Sake build pass.

   Standard Scheme definitions, variables, and Guile string formatting
utilities (‘format’, ‘string-join’, ‘map’) are fully accessible inside a
‘sakefile.scm’ to assemble build parameters dynamically.


